# Rook, and the purse he never opened.
dialogue rook4
  node root rook "You're back. You've a sunburn and a face like news. I've been bracing for news for three years, boy. It's mostly why I lean."
    > "We found the Arcadia." -> found
  node found fenn "On the reef, inside the Needle. Heeled over, masts up."
    -> inside
  node inside rook "Inside? Then he ran the Needle without the compass. The mad old— (He stops.) Is he…"
    > "He's alive, Rook. He's out on the Marrow." -> alive
    > "He says you owe him a reef." if (seen:ansel4.rook or seen:ansel.well) -> reef
  node alive narrator "Rook lets out a breath he seems to have been holding since the fruit boat."
    -> nothing
  node reef narrator "A laugh comes out of Rook like something rusty being opened. He puts a hand over his eyes and leaves it there a while."
    -> nothing
  node nothing rook "Then I've been drunk three years for nothing."
    -> thorough
  node thorough bramwick "Not for nothing. You've been very thorough."
    -> out
  node out narrator "Rook puts a small leather purse on the table. It's sealed with a little wax cloud, and the wax has never been broken."
    -> seal
  node seal rook "Cray's seal. Never opened. I was saving it for when I could look at it."
    > "You could look at it now." -> now
      give purse
      set purse_given
      note purse_seal "The purse they paid Rook off with still carries Cray's seal. Unopened, three years. He kept it the way a man keeps a wound he is not ready to look at."
      sound pickup
    > "(Take the purse.)" -> take
      give purse
      set purse_given
      sound pickup
  node now rook "Not yet. I'll look at it when there's a room full of people looking with me. Take it, boy. Hold it up at somebody."
    -> take
  node take narrator "I take the purse. It's heavier than three hundred crowns ought to be. Guilt has a weight; Cray just never had to carry it."
  # Afterwards.
  node hub rook "Still here, boy? There's a dawn coming, and I hear you've plans for it."
    > "Will you go back to sea?" if not seen:rook4.sea -> sea
    > "Has Bramwick been good company?" if not seen:rook4.company -> company
    > "Goodnight, Rook." -> bye
  node sea rook "If your father'll have me. I'd have to get sober. Mostly. Sober on weekdays, and twice on Tuesdays, to make up."
  node company rook "He's paid for every drink and apologised for every one. I've never been apologised to so expensively. I may let him keep going."
  node bye rook "Go on. The bar's still low, boy, but I've started climbing. Slowly. With a rope."
